<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Nov PPI rises 0.3 pct mo/mo, +4.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Nov PPI rises 0.3 pct mo/mo, +4.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices rose 0.3 percent in November, putting prices 4.2 percent higher than in the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
